#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Package Manager
#  File: package_manager.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS package manager responsible for:
#      • package registration
#      • dependency resolution
#      • installation & removal
#      • integrity verification
#      • version comparison
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Package Registry](ca://s?q=Explain_Package_Registry)
#    - [Dependency Resolution](ca://s?q=Explain_Dependency_Resolution)
#    - [Integrity Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Integrity_Verification)
#    - [Version Comparison](ca://s?q=Explain_Version_Comparison)
#    - [Installation Pipeline](ca://s?q=Explain_Installation_Pipeline)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register(manifest)
#         Registers a package manifest.
#
#    - resolve(pkg_id)
#         Computes dependency chain.
#
#    - verify(pkg_id, data)
#         Validates SHA-256 checksum.
#
#    - install(pkg_id, data)
#         Installs package + dependencies.
#
#    - remove(pkg_id)
#         Removes installed package.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full package manager state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MANIFEST STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "core.utils",
#      "version": "1.0.0",
#      "checksum": "<sha256>",
#      "dependencies": ["core.base"],
#      "metadata": { ... }
#    }
#
